{
  "activity_uuid": "activity_f6fa6c31-9a56-58f5-940d-8b1202d8c4c3",
  "name": "4.1 Directed numbers, magnitude and addition",
  "activity_type": "TYPE_DYNAMIC",
  "activity_sub_type": "SUBTYPE_DYNAMIC_PAGE",
  "content": {
    "type": "doc",
    "content": [
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 1
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Directed numbers, magnitude and addition"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Learning objective: ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Represent directed numbers on a number line and add using sign and magnitude."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Understand the concept"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "A directed number has a magnitude (distance from zero) and direction indicated by its sign. Positive numbers lie to the right of zero, negative numbers to the left. The sign of a number is not the same as the operation symbol."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "To add numbers with the same sign, add magnitudes and keep the sign. For opposite signs, subtract the smaller magnitude from the larger and keep the sign of the larger magnitude. Equal opposite magnitudes sum to zero."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "blockImage",
        "attrs": {
          "blockObject": {
            "block_uuid": "block_9ff45d55-3083-536e-a590-1568af5a800e",
            "content": {
              "file_id": "0c5dd183-6fb1-5e79-ab9b-4520d44ca835",
              "file_format": "png",
              "activity_uuid": "activity_f6fa6c31-9a56-58f5-940d-8b1202d8c4c3"
            }
          },
          "size": {
            "width": 900
          },
          "alignment": "center",
          "unsplash_url": null,
          "unsplash_photographer_name": null,
          "unsplash_photographer_url": null,
          "unsplash_photo_url": null
        }
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Start at −8; move 3 units right to −5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Worked examples"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Example 1: ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Calculate (−8) + (+3)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution: ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Move 3 units right from −8; the result is −5."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Example 2: ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Calculate (−2.4) + (−1.7)."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Solution: ",
            "marks": [
              {
                "type": "bold"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Same signs: 2.4 + 1.7 = 4.1, so the sum is −4.1."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "heading",
        "attrs": {
          "level": 2
        },
        "content": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "text": "Independent practice"
